// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1860173240" "It seems the Council has decided to try their hand at magic. They've managed to recover the bodies of several deceased Council leaders, and they're going to try to reanimate them! That's a dangerous proposition, to say nothing of disgusting. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to prevent the Council from reanimating their fallen leaders.</A> You'll have to hurry. The ceremony could take as little as 90 minutes."
// AcceptString :
"P2268096031" "Prevent the Council from reanimating their fallen leaders"
// SendOffString :
"P785010654" "I'm counting on you to stop this, {HeroName}. The Council is bad enough as it is!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3562925072" "Defeat all villains in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1044377106" "That Council ceremony has already started. Get over there, and you may still be able to do something about it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P98739890" "An eerie chanting fills the air."

