// Dialog :
"P2335366935" "Job well done, {HeroName}. I guess it's true that the Council will go to any lengths to gain any measure of power. Their roots date all the way back to the 1940's and, let me tell you, they've spawned some frightening characters during that time."
// RandomFameString :
"P560862303" "The Council had some sort of bad mojo going down, but {HeroName} was there to stop it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4004673979" "I don't know exactly who the Council managed to raise, but I expect they'll come calling soon enough. I guess it's true that the Council will go to any lengths to gain any measure of power. Their roots date all the way back to the 1940's and, let me tell you, they've spawned some frightening characters during that time."
// RandomFameString :
"P2638165384" "I hear the Council managed to raise one of their old leaders from the 1940's. I sure hope {HeroName} can protect us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4229198135" "Did you read the article about the Council in yesterday's Paragon City Free Press? Not too flattering. It brought up a number of incidents the Council would rather keep in the past, and even hinted at a former connection to a mysterious group called Arachnos. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you protect the Free Press' office from Council violence.</A> Please hurry. It's up to you to keep those presses rolling. You'll have only 60 minutes to stop the Council."
// AcceptString :
"P1644507882" "Protect the Free Press' office from Council violence"
// SendOffString :
"P4025253213" "It takes brave reporters to stand up to the Council's harassment. Take good care of their office, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3696480538" "Defeat all agents in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P689994336" "That newspaper could still be in danger. I need you to get over there right away."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P310947558" "We shall not allow the press to speak ill of the Council, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P393802667" "You hear some Council soldiers joking in the next room. From what they say, it is clear that this office has been booby trapped!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P636411968" "Did you rig anything good?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3883495290" "Yeah! Just wait 'til Mr. Editor turns on his computer!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2047883742" "I'll rip you apart, {HeroName}!"

