// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3046410385" "You rescued the Paragon City Free Press from the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2535694803" "You failed to prevent major damage to the Paragon City Free Press office."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2971744217" "Good work, {HeroName}. If you hadn't been there, those reporters would have suffered some nasty surprises the next time they showed up for work. I hope this experience won't deter them from saying what needs to be said. <br><br>The Council cares a lot about its reputation, {HeroName}, even more than the villain group they overthrew. The Council relies on a certain mystique to keep people in fear of them. If we can tear apart that fear, perhaps we can tear apart the Council itself."
// RandomFameString :
"P240096894" "There was a big feature on {HeroName} in the Paragon City Free Press today."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P358511660" "The Council set off some explosives in that newsroom. There were some injuries, but most of the damage was to the building itself. The Paragon City Free Press may have to relocate for a short time, but I think this incident will only strengthen their resolve to tell the stories that need to be heard."
// RandomFameString :
"P1355243210" "The Free Press won't be on newsstands for a few weeks; they have to find a new office."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2148025477" "I need you to get over to the Paragon City Museum's storehouse right away. The Council is there, and they seem intent on destroying next week's exhibit. I don't know what they've got against 20th century Italian art, but it seems they're willing to do violence to keep it out of the public eye. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to prevent the Council from destroying that exhibit.</A> You'll have only 60 minutes to stop them. And if those exhibits bite the dust, I think we'll have to call this mission a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P2093135346" "Prevent the Council from destroying the exhibit"
// SendOffString :
"P332493305" "They say those who forget history are doomed to repeat it. Let's not let that happen, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2743565860" "Stop destruction of art exhibit"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1987774310" "That exhibit the Council is after includes a large number of beautiful sculptures. It would be a crime to let them be destroyed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3681140951" "No one will set eyes on that exhibit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2443097787" "You hear the whoosh of air as a flamethrower ignites."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
