// Dialog :
"P632746428" "You prevented the Council from destroying the Italian art exhibit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2322764692" "You failed to defeat the Council in time to prevent them from destroying the Italian art exhibit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3484914758" "I got a look at one of those sculptures you saved from the Council. It looks like it's a bust that was made of Paolo Tirelli, the low-level Italian dignitary who went on to become the Council's revered Center. No doubt the Council wanted to keep people from seeing Tirelli as he really is: an unremarkable man with a weak chin. As long as they keep the Center shrouded in mystery, people's fear of him will be easier to maintain."
// RandomFameString :
"P3170706797" "Did you see that Italian art exhibit that {HeroName} saved? I'll never forget it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3390009701" "I know you did your best, {HeroName}. We lost a lot of beautiful works of art, but I'm grateful that at least you weren't hurt."
// RandomFameString :
"P894106782" "I heard the Council destroyed a whole museum exhibit. I ask you, where was {HeroName}?"

