"P1118622120" "The district attorney's story"
// DetailString :
"P415652763" "When you rescued him, District Attorney Hansen told you:<br><br>'Last week I was handed a case involving a soldier who had left the Council. But it was obvious that the evidence was trumped up, and I dropped the case. That's when the Council came after me. They told me if I didn't prosecute, I'd be sorry. Thanks, {HeroName}. If it weren't for you, I don't think I would have made it out of here alive.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
