// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1674980130" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, I need you to rescue the district attorney from the Council!</A> They're at his office right now, tearing it to pieces! You'll have to move quickly if you want to save the people inside! You'll only have 90 minutes to stop the Council!"
// AcceptString :
"P3749703149" "Rescue the district attorney from the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P3868364563" "District Attorney Hansen has put a lot of Council soldiers behind bars; this raid could be their attempt at revenge."
