"P537673973" "There were some injuries, but the police were able to get Hansen and his staff out of there. It seems this whole case was about Hansen standing up to the Council. They wanted him to prosecute an unjust case against one of their former members, and he said no. That had to take guts. I'm glad he'll be all right."
