// Dialog :
"P828654782" "You retrieved a sample of the Rikti virus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1934318728" "You stopped the Rikti plot to infect Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2592554736" "Take virus to Jenny Firkins"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4009884450" "Jenny needs to get a look at that virus, post haste."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1027461085" "Give up the virus or die!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3303181206" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I'll analyze the virus, and see what I can do about an antidote. You know, I'm a little worried about the presence of the Council at that base. Sure, the Council are human like the rest of us, and I'm sure they don't want to see the city gassed any more than you do. Still. The Council rarely does anything without a hidden agenda. <br><br>I'd appreciate it if you could trail one of the agents back to their base. Make sure they're not up to anything nefarious."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1677518559" "Learn Council's plan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P142762921" "I need to be sure that the Council isn't planning anything dangerous."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2626408348" "The Council will not tolerate your interference, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2508670155" "You trailed one of the Council agents back to this base. If his comrades are up to anything sneaky, you'll uncover it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P715472489" "Have you taken the vaccine yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3507643402" "Not yet. I hate needles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2294516478" "You'll be the first to fall!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1785292137" "The new virus is almost ready!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P27801378" "Without our vaccine, the heroes won't stand a chance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P683224438" "Ah, a test subject!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1238378276" "The new virus will be just potent enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2981558115" "With the heroes flat on their backs, we'll roll over this city!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4193753086" "I'll tear you limb from limb!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ImportantCrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2603522672" "You begin to search the crate."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3854780254" "You finish searching the crate."
// InteractActionString :
"P1469950025" "Searching..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1355754319" "You found a sample of a virus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - EmptyCrates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3520328332" "You found nothing of interest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1092532493" "You found evidence against the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1578762223" "I have to admit, even I find it hard to believe the Council would have released that modified virus on the populace. It might not have resulted in widespread death like the original Rikti virus, but I wouldn't be surprised to learn it had some nasty side effects. I guess there's no limit to how far some people will go for power."
// RandomFameString :
"P1008682421" "{HeroName} stopped the Council from poisoning the whole city!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LeonSaga 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3000074932" "Leon Natale's story"
// DetailString :
"P1409224925" "When you rescued Leon Natale from the Council, he told you:<br><br>'I thought the Council was something I'd put behind me. See, my dad was in the Council back in the 50's. Embarrassing, I know. I haven't heard from him in years though. I don't know what the Council wanted with me, but I can tell you they were really careful not to injure me.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PlanData 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3672175276" "Council file"
// DetailString :
"P528410111" "This file, taken from a Council computer, lists the names of several Council members who participated in a dangerous experiment in 1982. According to the file, these men were given a barrage of hormonal and mutagenic treatments to radically alter their DNA. The children of these men were expected to be exceptionally strong. The file says, 'They are likely to be perfect candidates for Ravenna.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P52073012" "I just got a call from the wife of Leon Natale, the famous body builder. She said some Council goons broke into her house this morning and kidnapped her husband right out of his weight room! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue Leon Natale from the Council.</A> If he was targeted, they must want him for some nefarious purpose."
// AcceptString :
"P3368693676" "Rescue Leon Natale from the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P744255270" "I met Leon once at a pro wrestling event. He's a good guy, {HeroName}. Don't let him down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1385868753" "Find kidnapped body builder"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2555616486" "Have you found Leon Natale yet? Time's a-wasting!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1546627308" "Leon Natale belongs to the Council, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3496467663" "A scuffed floor and a torn Council jacket show that Leon Natale did not give up without a fight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1841099094" "I, too, hope to go to Ravenna someday."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3195582581" "Leon Natale is a lucky, lucky man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2433564767" "Will he survive the process?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1215936003" "He ought to. His dad did."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4145527906" "Time to die, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Werner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1375008602" "Leon Natale"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P3627704458" "I've got to tell you something!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3372666113" "You rescued Leon Natale from the Council. After calling your contact, you receive instructions to send Natale to speak to Allison King, the memory archaeologist."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1092764088" "Speak to Allison King"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P988465702" "Allison King already finished debriefing Leon. You should go see if she discovered anything useful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2113924037" "You won't live to rescue the others!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2160240519" "Well, I've spoken to Leon, and I've learned something quite serious. While plumbing Leon's memories, I discovered that his father, Archon Natale, was a member of an elite group of Council soldiers who had volunteered for something called the Scion Experiment. I've searched Leon's memories for the names of the other participants and cross-checked them against recent missing persons reports. It seems that many of the other participants' children are also missing. You've got to find them, {HeroName}! I also need you to search for documentation on the Council's plan. There may be other intended victims we don't know about."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Compound2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4100835933" "Defeat base leader & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1001386529" "Who knows what the Council plans to do to those people? Whatever it is, we can't just abandon them to their fate!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4152803534" "We've invested too much to let you stop us, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1830493998" "You have to admire Leon Natale's ability to overcome his father's twisted ideals. It's jobs like this that really make you feel like a hero."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1740417425" "Luthyr"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1805274204" "Ready the candidates for transport."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P544630966" "We will have our creatures of the night!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1644728217" "people to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1374389461" "Save the last person!"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P1088682140" "They said we were strong enough to survive the process!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P3352584665" "They said we'd be their fiercest warriors!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P166759754" "They told me my dad knew this would happen!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P1944114016" "They said they'd been watching us for years!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4105117061" "Computer"
// Description :
"P2267699148" "Find data on plan"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3348388328" "You begin to access the computer."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P804164300" "You have accessed the computer."
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1724089685" "You found some data on the Council's plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1748167201" "You rescued the hostages from the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1888471665" "I've got the full story for you, {HeroName}, but I have to warn you, it's pretty ugly. Leon and the rest of those poor souls were deliberately bred by the Council, as candidates for conversion into War Wolves. The Council needed exceptionally strong candidates, so they tried to engineer them. Pretty sick, huh? Those men were marked since before they were born! <br><br>Something else bothers me, {HeroName}. The Council didn't have anything like the War Wolves back in the 80's. No, the War Wolves were the weapons of a group they recently overthrew. But if they launched the Scion Experiment before Leon Natale was born, they've been planning that takeover for more than two decades! It's hard to know how to contend with a villain that insidious. I'm, glad Paragon City has you on her side."
// RandomFameString :
"P1856176342" "Did you hear how {HeroName} saved Leon Natale from the Council?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3267852742" "There's a problem in Brickstown that needs a hero's special touch. Council soldiers have been harassing the prison guards at the Ziggurat. Many of them don't even feel like it's safe to come to work anymore. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to the Brickstown and convince those Council agents to get their jollies elsewhere.</A> Otherwise, the penitentiary could be looking at a major turnover crisis."
// AcceptString :
"P1514253571" "Go to the Brickstown and convince the Council agents to get their jollies elsewhere"
// SendOffString :
"P1004546998" "Being a guard at the Big Zig is no one's idea of a dream job. We owe it to those guards to guarantee their safety."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P832581327" "Combat Council in Brickstown"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P208273782" "Those Council agents are still harassing the Ziggurat guards."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1627305784" "Keep out of Brickstown, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1847640305" "You discouraged the Council agents from harassing the Ziggurat guards."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2865280731" "Warden Stanley just called; he wanted to thank you for getting rid of those Council goons. If you ever consider a career in the correction industry, he says you should give him a call."
// RandomFameString :
"P1616546103" "My brother's a guard over at the Big Zig. Thanks to {HeroName}, he can do his job without being harassed by the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P996212060" "The Council's propaganda seems to be having an effect on the people in Founders' Falls. I guess everyone needs someone to look up to, and the Council's power lets them take advantage of that. I'd like you to head over there and engage some Council soldiers in combat. People have a lot of respect for you in this town, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got the power to discourage folks from joining the Council.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3194101206" "Discourage folks from joining the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P4055947807" "You've got to show Founders' Falls the Council's true colors."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1909377429" "Combat Council in Founders' Falls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3729284601" "You haven't done enough to discourage people from joining the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1458848509" "Founders' Falls is our territory, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1385760077" "You discouraged people in Founders' Falls from joining the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1179311789" "Good work, {HeroName}. With you on the streets, the folks in Founders' Falls will have someone worthwhile to look up to. They won't have to waste their admiration on the Council."
// RandomFameString :
"P3158575225" "Did you see {HeroName} wail on those Council losers in Founders' Falls?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Council_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2843954024" "The Council takes its battles with the city's heroes personally, {HeroName}, but it seems that they've decided to target you especially. With your reputation, they think that if they can prove they can defeat you, it will help them intimidate newer heroes and keep anyone from disrupting their operations. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The only way to combat this operation is to fight the Council head-on wherever they appear.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2689699799" "Fight the Council head-on wherever they appear"
// SendOffString :
"P493122222" "The Council are ruthless enemies, {HeroName}, but I have every confidence that you'll succeed against them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4272311310" "Fight the Council head-on"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P192595487" "Some of the other heroes I work with have found Council propaganda proclaiming your defeat already printed up and ready to distribute. You have to show them how wrong they are."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1780385977" "We'll show the city our strength by defeating you, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1435420453" "You have defeated enough Council soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3541412882" "They say that you can judge a person by their enemies, {HeroName}. By that measure, you've demonstrated your heroism beyond any doubt."
// RandomFameString :
"P2121175376" "The Council can't beat {HeroName}! There's no way the could ever win."

